{"id":209,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"教科指導を厚くする山手学院中高","feature_description":"山手学院中学校・高等学校は、中高6年間を通した手厚くきめ細やかな教科指導を特徴としています。中学では自主的に学習に取り組む姿勢を育て、高校では進路に応じたカリキュラムで受験に向けた実践力を伸ばす方針が公式サイトに示されています。朝読書や班学習も学びに組み込まれ、国際交流の案内も見られます。学習習慣の定着を日常的に支える構成です。","clubs":[{"id":4630,"name":"空手道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yamate-gakuin.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4631,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yamate-gakuin.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4632,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yamate-gakuin.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4633,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yamate-gakuin.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4634,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yamate-gakuin.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4635,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yamate-gakuin.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4636,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yamate-gakuin.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4637,"name":"ダンス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yamate-gakuin.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4638,"name":"チアリーダー部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yamate-gakuin.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4639,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yamate-gakuin.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4640,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yamate-gakuin.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4641,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yamate-gakuin.ac.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4642,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://